<title>USA: Employee Solutions postpones Q4 report.</title>
<headline>Employee Solutions postpones Q4 report.</headline>
<dateline>PHOENIX, Ariz. 1997-03-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Employee Solutions Inc said it would not release its fourth quarter and full year results on Thursday, March 13, as previously planned.</p>
<p>The company did not give a reason for the delay of a new date.</p>
</text>
